<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Shed | Create Your Shopper Account</title>
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16x16.png">
  <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jost:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html, body { min-height: 100%; font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; }
    body { display: flex; min-height: 100vh; background: #0d0d1a; }

    .auth-left { width: 38%; background: #0d0d1a; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 70px 52px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .auth-left::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -80px; right: -80px; width: 340px; height: 340px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,152,0,0.08); }
    .auth-left::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -60px; left: -40px; width: 240px; height: 240px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,152,0,0.05); }
    .auth-logo { margin-bottom: 44px; }
    .auth-logo img { width: 120px; height: auto; }
    .auth-tagline h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .auth-tagline h1 span { color: #FF9800; }
    .auth-tagline p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .auth-steps { margin-top: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
    .auth-step { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; }
    .step-num { width: 28px; height: 28px; min-width: 28px; background: #FF9800; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
    .step-text { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .step-text strong { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); display: block; }

    .auth-right { flex: 1; background: #fff; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; padding: 56px 48px; overflow-y: auto; }
    .auth-form-box { width: 100%; max-width: 480px; }
    .auth-form-box h2 { font-size: 1.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0d0d1a; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .auth-form-box .subtitle { color: #888; font-size: 0.93rem; margin-bottom: 32px; }

    .row { display: flex; gap: 18px; }
    .col-half { flex: 1; }

    .form-group { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .form-group label { display: block; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 7px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    .form-control { width: 100%; padding: 12px 15px; border: 1.5px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; color: #222; background: #fafafa; transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
    .form-control:focus { outline: none; border-color: #FF9800; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,152,0,0.1); }

    .btn-auth { width: 100%; padding: 14px; background: #FF9800; color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s; margin-top: 10px; }
    .btn-auth:hover { background: #e68900; transform: translateY(-1px); }

    .password-requirements { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #999; margin-top: 8px; list-style: none; padding: 0; }
    .password-requirements li { margin: 3px 0; }

    .error-banner { background: #fff5f5; border: 1px solid #fcc; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; color: #c0392b; font-size: 0.88rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }

    .auth-links { text-align: center; margin-top: 24px; color: #888; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .auth-links a { color: #FF9800; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; }
    .auth-links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      body { flex-direction: column; }
      .auth-left { width: 100%; padding: 40px 28px; }
      .auth-right { padding: 40px 20px; }
      .row { flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="auth-left">
    <div class="auth-logo"><a href="/"><img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Shed"></a></div>
    <div class="auth-tagline">
      <h1>Find the <span>shed</span> that has it</h1>
      <p>Search every shed on the platform for what you need, add it all to one cart, and track every order from your own dashboard.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="auth-steps">
      <div class="auth-step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-text"><strong>Create your account</strong>Just your name, email and a password.</div></div>
      <div class="auth-step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-text"><strong>Verify your email</strong>We'll send you a 6-digit code.</div></div>
      <div class="auth-step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-text"><strong>Find &amp; buy</strong>Search sheds for what you need, cart across stores, checkout once.</div></div>
      <div class="auth-step"><div class="step-num">4</div><div class="step-text"><strong>Track it all</strong>Every purchase, from every shed, in one dashboard.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="auth-right">
    <div class="auth-form-box">
      <h2>Create your shopper account</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">It's free to sign up and start finding sheds that have what you need.</p>

      <% if (error) { %><div class="error-banner"><%= error %></div><% } %>

      <form action="/shopper/register" method="POST">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-half form-group">
            <label for="firstName">First Name</label>
            <input class="form-control" type="text" id="firstName" name="firstName" value="<%= firstName %>" required>
          </div>
          <div class="col-half form-group">
            <label for="lastName">Last Name</label>
            <input class="form-control" type="text" id="lastName" name="lastName" value="<%= lastName %>" required>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">Email Address</label>
          <input class="form-control" type="email" id="email" name="email" value="<%= email %>" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="phone">Phone Number</label>
          <input class="form-control" type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" value="<%= phone %>" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="password">Password</label>
          <input class="form-control" type="password" id="password" name="password" required>
          <ul class="password-requirements">
            <li>At least 8 characters</li>
            <li>One uppercase letter, one lowercase letter, one number</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="confirmPassword">Confirm Password</label>
          <input class="form-control" type="password" id="confirmPassword" name="confirmPassword" required>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn-auth">Create Account</button>
      </form>

      <div class="auth-links">Already have an account? <a href="/shopper/login">Log in</a></div>
      <div class="auth-links" style="margin-top:8px;">Own a store instead? <a href="/admin-register">Register as a store owner</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
